  "ps3.8:13.14": "tena vuccati ",
  "ps3.8:13.15": "dhammesu dhammānupassanā satipaṭṭhānabhāvanā. ",
  "ps3.8:14.1": "bhāvanāti catasso bhāvanā ",
  "ps3.8:14.2": "tattha jātānaṃ dhammānaṃ anativattanaṭṭhena bhāvanā indriyānaṃ ekarasaṭṭhena bhāvanā tadupagaviriyavāhanaṭṭhena bhāvanā āsevanaṭṭhena bhāvanā …pe… ",
  "ps3.8:14.3": "evaṃ dhammesu dhammānupassī viharatīti. ",
